{"id":"b7e797c34bb8300c","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-antipodal.md","title":"Antipodal Points","display":"df-antipodal — Antipodal Points","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-antipodal","aliases":["58-df-antipodal","Antipodal Points"],"display":"df-antipodal — Antipodal Points","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-sphere.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-antipodal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-antipodal</span><span>Antipodal Points</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-antipodal — Antipodal Points"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed44d43cf74ca35e\" href=\"?note=ed44d43cf74ca35e\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sphere.md\">../batch08/58-df-sphere.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,x,y\\in V\">\\(n,x,y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^n=\\{x\\in\\mathbb{R}^{n+1}\\mid \\|x\\|=1\\}\">\\(S^n=\\{x\\in\\mathbb{R}^{n+1}\\mid \\|x\\|=1\\}\\)</span> (sphere, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed44d43cf74ca35e\" href=\"?note=ed44d43cf74ca35e\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sphere.md\">../batch08/58-df-sphere.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Antipodal}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Antipodal}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (antipodal-pair predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}antipodal} \\vdash \\mathrm{Antipodal}_S(x,y,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land x\\in S^n\\land y\\in S^n\\land y=-x\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}antipodal} \\vdash \\mathrm{Antipodal}_S(x,y,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land x\\in S^n\\land y\\in S^n\\land y=-x\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Antipodal: opposite points on sphere, maximum distance apart</li>\n<li>Antipodal map: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A: S^n \\to S^n, x \\mapsto -x\">\\(A: S^n \\to S^n, x \\mapsto -x\\)</span>, degree <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(-1)^{n+1}\">\\((-1)^{n+1}\\)</span></li>\n<li>Ham-sandwich: any <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> continuous masses in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}^n\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^n\\)</span> can be bisected by one hyperplane</li>\n<li>Borsuk-Ulam consequence: every continuous <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:S^n\\to\\mathbb{R}^n\">\\(f:S^n\\to\\mathbb{R}^n\\)</span> has <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in S^n\">\\(x\\in S^n\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x)=f(A_n(x))\">\\(f(x)=f(A_n(x))\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{RP}^n = S^n / \\{x \\sim -x\\}\">\\(\\mathbb{RP}^n = S^n / \\{x \\sim -x\\}\\)</span>: quotient by antipodal identification</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Matousek, Using the Borsuk-Ulam Theorem</li>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-sphere.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed44d43cf74ca35e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-sphere.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-sphere.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed44d43cf74ca35e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S^n=\\{x\\in\\mathbb{R}^{n+1}\\mid \\|x\\|=1\\}$ (sphere, see [[../batch08/58-df-sphere.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n,x,y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"S^n=\\{x\\in\\mathbb{R}^{n+1}\\mid \\|x\\|=1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Antipodal}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}antipodal} \\vdash \\mathrm{Antipodal}_S(x,y,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land x\\in S^n\\land y\\in S^n\\land y=-x","display":true},{"tex":"A: S^n \\to S^n, x \\mapsto -x","display":false},{"tex":"(-1)^{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}^n","display":false},{"tex":"f:S^n\\to\\mathbb{R}^n","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in S^n","display":false},{"tex":"f(x)=f(A_n(x))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{RP}^n = S^n / \\{x \\sim -x\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1129,"backlinks":[{"id":"77a834d62558f993","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-137","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-antipodal.md|58-df-antipodal]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["ed44d43cf74ca35e"]}